      "content": "thanks for the info. but calling it \"hyperesthesia\" or just \"heightened awareness\" feels like it's underselling what's actually happening. it doesn't just feel like my senses are \"sensitive,\" it feels like my actual biological capacity is expanding—like my brain is unlocking parts of the spectrum it was previously walled off from. \n\nif this is triggered by \"spiritual or psychic stimulation,\" doesn't that imply a fundamental shift in how my biology interacts with the world? if this is a real transition, shouldn't there be more of a biological framework for it? like, are there ways to physiologically prepare my nervous system for this kind of data expansion so the \"hyperactivity\" doesn't eventually lead to burnout or damage?",
